{
  "info": {
    "name": "KapselRPLD — Interoperabilitas FHIR (Demo & Test)",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk KapselRPLD (OpenMRS ↔ OpenEMR ↔ SATUSEHAT).\n\n## Cara pakai\n1. Import collection + environment (KapselRPLD — Local (mock)). Pilih environment di kanan atas.\n2. Jalankan stack: `docker compose up -d --build` lalu `docker compose exec backend python seed.py`.\n3. Pastikan `.env`: SATUSEHAT_MODE=mock, OPENMRS_MODE=mock, OPENEMR_MODE=mock (untuk demo penuh offline).\n4. Buka folder sesuai alur presentasi (lihat README di folder postman/).\n\n## Otomatis\n- Collection pre-request script login `admin` otomatis dan menyimpan `adminToken`.\n- Request login juga menyimpan `adminToken` / `operatorToken` / `viewerToken`.\n- Setiap request punya test (status code + assert kunci).\n\n## Alur presentasi (ringkas)\nA. Patient dari OpenMRS → OpenEMR (adapter).\nB. Patient/Encounter/Observation dari OpenMRS → SATUSEHAT (adapter, pakai builder transaction Bundle).\nC. Observasi + Idempotency + Konflik.\nD. RBAC (viewer ditolak, operator/admin diizinkan).\nE. Inbound selektif dari SATUSEHAT + SSRME.\nF. Operasional (metrics/audit/prometheus).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{adminToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-login admin (simpan adminToken) agar request ber-auth langsung jalan.",
          "const baseUrl = pm.variables.get('baseUrl');",
          "const body = { username: pm.variables.get('adminUser'), password: pm.variables.get('adminPassword') };",
          "pm.sendRequest({",
          "  url: baseUrl + '/api/v1/auth/login',",
          "  method: 'POST',",
          "  header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },",
          "  body: { mode: 'raw', raw: JSON.stringify(body) }",
          "}, function (err, res) {",
          "  if (!err && res.code === 200) { try { pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', res.json().token); } catch (e) {} }",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "operatorToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "viewerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "lastJobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "openemrJobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "satusehatPatientJobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "satusehatEncounterJobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "satusehatObsJobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "mappingId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "conflictId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "policyId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Health & Auth (RBAC)",
      "description": "Cek layanan hidup dan login untuk tiap peran. Menyimpan token ke variabel.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test('status = ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login admin (simpan adminToken)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const j = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('role admin', () => pm.expect(j.role).to.eql('admin'));",
            "pm.test('ada token', () => pm.expect(j.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', j.token);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login operator (simpan operatorToken)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const j = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('role operator', () => pm.expect(j.role).to.eql('operator'));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('operatorToken', j.token);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{operatorUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{operatorPassword}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","login"] }
